// features: comparison, int-arith, locals, print, ranges
// E2E: bare range values print as s..e with structural equality (#254).
// The C runtime range used to be a degenerate start-marker (printed
// s..s) and chunk boxes rendered pointer bits; both backends now share
// a first-class (start, end, step) value.
r := 0..5
println(r)
println(2..7)
println((0..5) == (0..5))
println((0..5) == (0..6))
println((0..5) == (1..5))
